msgstr "الإدخالات السابقة"

#: admin/views/past-entries.php:29
msgid ""
"Bring in the entries your forms collected before EntryVault was installed. "
"Run it as often as you like: entries already here are skipped, never copied "
"twice."
msgstr ""
"اجلب الإدخالات التي جمعتها نماذجك قبل تثبيت EntryVault. شغّل ذلك كلما أردت: "
"الإدخالات الموجودة هنا تُتخطّى ولا تُنسخ مرتين أبدًا."

#: admin/views/past-entries.php:34
msgid "Nothing to bring in"
msgstr "لا شيء لجلبه"

#: admin/views/past-entries.php:34
msgid ""
"No past entries found that EntryVault can read. It can bring in entries from "
"Gravity Forms, WPForms (not WPForms Lite, which keeps none), Fluent Forms, "
"Forminator, SureForms, Trinity Forms, Formidable, Ninja Forms, Everest "
"Forms, MetForm, and Contact Form 7 messages saved by Flamingo or CFDB7."
msgstr ""
"لم يتم العثور على إدخالات سابقة يستطيع EntryVault قراءتها. يمكنه جلب "
"الإدخالات من Gravity Forms وWPForms (وليس WPForms Lite، التي لا تحتفظ بأي "
"إدخال) وFluent Forms وForminator وSureForms وTrinity Forms وFormidable "
"وNinja Forms وEverest Forms وMetForm، ورسائل Contact Form 7 المحفوظة عبر "
"Flamingo أو CFDB7."

#. translators: %s: form plugin name.
#: admin/views/past-entries.php:48
#, php-format
msgid "%s offers a public way to read its entries, and EntryVault uses it."
msgstr "توفر %s طريقة عامة لقراءة إدخالاتها، ويستخدمها EntryVault."

#: admin/views/past-entries.php:50
msgid ""
"Made by the same team as EntryVault, which reads its entries directly and is "
"kept in step with it."
msgstr ""
"من صنع فريق EntryVault نفسه، الذي يقرأ إدخالاتها مباشرة ويبقيها متوافقة معه."

#: admin/views/past-entries.php:57
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "أبلغ عن مشكلة"

#: admin/views/past-entries.php:62
msgid "What \"Report a problem\" sends"
msgstr "ما الذي يرسله \"أبلغ عن مشكلة\""

#: admin/views/past-entries.php:63
msgid ""
"Sent by your site's email to the EntryVault team, only when you click: the "
"form plugin and its version, the EntryVault, WordPress and PHP versions, and "
"the database check. No entries, names or email addresses, and not your site "
"address."
msgstr ""
"يُرسل عبر بريد موقعك إلى فريق EntryVault، فقط عند النقر: إضافة النماذج "
"وإصدارها، وإصدارات EntryVault وWordPress وPHP، وفحص قاعدة البيانات. لا "
"إدخالات ولا أسماء ولا عناوين بريد إلكتروني، ولا عنوان موقعك."

#: admin/views/past-entries.php:76
msgid "Cannot read"
msgstr "تتعذّر القراءة"

#. translators: 1: form plugin name, 2: list of missing tables or columns.
#: admin/views/past-entries.php:79
#, php-format
msgid ""
"EntryVault checked the %1$s database first and did not find what it expects "
"(missing: %2$s). Nothing was read. This usually means %1$s changed its "
"database in an update. Please use \"Report a problem\" so EntryVault can be "
"fixed."
msgstr ""
"فحص EntryVault قاعدة بيانات %1$s أولًا ولم يجد ما يتوقعه (المفقود: %2$s). لم "
"تتم قراءة أي شيء. هذا يعني عادةً أن %1$s غيّرت قاعدة بياناتها في تحديث. الرجاء "
"استخدام \"أبلغ عن مشكلة\" ليتم إصلاح EntryVault."

